      "text": "class QuoteInput:\n    quantity: i64\n\nclass Quote:\n    quantity: i64\n    total_minor: i64\n\nenum QuoteError:\n    InvalidQuantity\n\n@rust(\"native::pause\")\nextern async def pause() -> unit\n\n@rust(\"native::run_server\")\nextern async def run_server(port: i64) -> Result[unit, Error]\n\nasync def calculate(input: QuoteInput) -> Result[Quote, QuoteError]:\n    if input.quantity < 1 or input.quantity > 100:\n        return fail(QuoteError.InvalidQuantity)\n    await pause()\n    return ok(Quote(quantity=input.quantity, total_minor=input.quantity * 1250))\n\nasync def main() -> Result[unit, Error]:\n    port = try parse_i64(env(\"NAGI_SAMPLE_PORT\", \"8097\"))\n    return await run_server(port)\n"
